---
source: src/tui/mod.rs
expression: "&frame"
---
"Keys                                                                    1-22/110"
"Anywhere                                                                        "
"  Ctrl+Z                                  Suspend to the shell                  "
"  Ctrl+L                                  Redraw the screen                     "
"                                                                                "
"Transcript, also under a question                                               "
"  Ctrl+X                                  Show or hide the todo panel           "
"  PgUp / PgDn                             Scroll the transcript a page          "
"  Shift+Up / Shift+Down                   Scroll the transcript a line          "
"  End                                     Jump back to the newest output when   "
"                                          scrolled                              "
"  Mouse wheel                             Scroll the transcript                 "
"                                                                                "
"Composer                                                                        "
"  Enter                                   Send the line; on an empty composer,  "
"                                          open or close the focused row         "
"  Shift+Enter / Alt+Enter / Ctrl+J        Insert a newline                      "
"  Up / Down                               Walk the history on a one-line        "
"                                          composer                              "
"  Ctrl+R                                  Search the history                    "
"  Alt+Up                                  Take the newest queued line back to   "
"                                          edit                                  "
"  Ctrl+O                                  Edit the line in $VISUAL or $EDITOR,  "
"j/k scroll  PgUp/PgDn page  q close                                             "
